{% comment %}
  snippets/product-mock-briefsieve.liquid
  HTML/CSS mockup of the BriefSieve morning brief. Decorative — the figures
  are invented sample data (the product's own demo is seeded the same way).
  What it shows is real: a brief written from synced channels, KPI tiles,
  BYOK connectors, and a guru that narrates pre-computed numbers and never
  calculates them. Regions carry data-mock-region for the chip highlight.
  Usage: {% render 'product-mock-briefsieve', name: 'BriefSieve' %}
{% endcomment %}
<div class="bvx-mock bvx-mock--briefsieve" role="img" aria-label="{{ name | default: 'BriefSieve' }} dashboard: this morning's brief, three KPI tiles, five connected channels and a question answered by the guru with the numbers it used">
  <div class="bvx-mock__bar" aria-hidden="true">
    <span class="bvx-mock__dot"></span><span class="bvx-mock__dot"></span><span class="bvx-mock__dot"></span>
    <span class="bvx-mock__title">{{ name | default: 'BriefSieve' }} · Tuesday brief · 07:00</span>
  </div>

  <div class="bvx-mock__body" aria-hidden="true">
    <div class="bvx-mock__region bvx-mock__card bvx-mock__brief" data-mock-region="brief">
      <span class="bvx-mock__label">This morning · 3 things</span>
      <ol class="bvx-mock__lines">
        <li><b>Meta ROAS fell to 2.1</b> from 2.8. CPM on the retargeting set is up 18%; conversion held.</li>
        <li><b>Stock cover on 16g titanium labrets:</b> 9 days at the current run rate.</li>
        <li><b>Klaviyo win-back flow converted 4.2%</b> — the best week in six.</li>
      </ol>
    </div>

    <div class="bvx-mock__region bvx-mock__kpis" data-mock-region="kpis">
      <div class="bvx-mock__kpi"><span class="bvx-mock__label">Revenue · 7d</span><b>$48.2k</b><em class="is-up">+6%</em><i class="bvx-mock__fill bvx-mock__fill--thin" style="--w:72%"></i></div>
      <div class="bvx-mock__kpi"><span class="bvx-mock__label">Blended ROAS</span><b>2.1</b><em class="is-down">−0.7</em><i class="bvx-mock__fill bvx-mock__fill--thin" style="--w:44%"></i></div>
      <div class="bvx-mock__kpi"><span class="bvx-mock__label">Orders · 7d</span><b>612</b><em class="is-up">+3%</em><i class="bvx-mock__fill bvx-mock__fill--thin" style="--w:63%"></i></div>
    </div>

    <div class="bvx-mock__region bvx-mock__channels" data-mock-region="channels">
      <span class="bvx-mock__label">Connected · your keys · synced 06:40</span>
      <div class="bvx-mock__chips">
        <span class="bvx-mock__chip">Shopify</span>
        <span class="bvx-mock__chip">Meta Ads</span>
        <span class="bvx-mock__chip">Google Ads</span>
        <span class="bvx-mock__chip">Klaviyo</span>
        <span class="bvx-mock__chip">Amazon</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="bvx-mock__region bvx-mock__card bvx-mock__chat" data-mock-region="guru">
      <p class="bvx-mock__q">Why did ROAS drop on Tuesday?</p>
      <p class="bvx-mock__a">Retargeting CPM rose 18% while conversion stayed at 3.1%. Spend did not change — the cost of each impression did. <em>Figures from your Meta Ads sync, 06:40.</em></p>
      <span class="bvx-mock__note">Numbers are computed first, then narrated. The model never does the arithmetic.</span>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
